OL,3,GNEWSAInspectors give SEND care home
OL,4,Aglowing review
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home for younger adults with
OL,7,Fspecial educational needs has had its
OL,8,Frating upgraded from good to
OL,9,Foutstanding by the regulator following
OL,10,Fan inspection.
OL,12,FThe Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,13,Fvisited Cecil Road, in Dronfield,
OL,14,FDerbyshire, for a routine inspection in
OL,15,FAugust and September.
OL,17,FInspectors said staff at the home had a
OL,18,F"brilliant understanding of autism" and
OL,19,Fwere "visible, approachable and
OL,20,Fgenuinely committed" to improving the
OL,21,Flives of its six residents.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
